          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>Where Indian Artistry Meets Everyday Living</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Mandala Collection by Social India Craft</strong> is a celebration of colour, symmetry and Indian-inspired artistry.</p><p>Each piece brings together the timeless character of <strong>copper craftsmanship</strong> with intricate mandala-inspired designs, creating a harmonious balance between traditional artistic expression and contemporary aesthetics.</p><p>Inspired by the mandala—an enduring symbol found across Indian art and culture—the collection reflects ideas of <strong>balance, harmony, unity and wholeness</strong>. </p><p>Every design has its own character, while remaining connected to the visual language of the collection.</p><p>Created for modern living, these pieces are more than functional objects. They are thoughtfully designed expressions of <strong>Indian craftsmanship, creativity and cultural inspiration</strong>.</p><p> </p>"
